ouse#The_Counting_House_-_High_Security_Vaults\" title=\"The Counting House\">The Counting House - High Security Vaults</a>, which contains:\n<ul><li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Skeletons_in_Patriar_Closets\" title=\"Skeletons in Patriar Closets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/Book_Generic_J_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Skeletons_in_Patriar_Closets\" title=\"Skeletons in Patriar Closets\">Skeletons in Patriar Closets</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Patriar_Blackmail_Files\" title=\"The Patriar Blackmail Files\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/40px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png/20px-Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Book_Note_D_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Patriar_Blackmail_Files\" title=\"The Patriar Blackmail Files\">The Patriar Blackmail Files</a></li>\n<li>Several pieces of jewellery and gems</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>See <a href=\"/wiki/The_Counting_House#Loot\" title=\"The Counting House\">The Counting House</a> for a list of key locations</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201602\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2086/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 30434/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8055/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.020/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1032177/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   51.712      1 -total\n 98.48%   50.926      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n 34.79%   17.993      5 Template:Icon_text\n 34.56%   17.872     26 Template:Trim\n 23.32%   12.061      2 Template:SmRarityItem\n 18.52%    9.575      2 Template:Item_icon\n 17.45%    9.024      2 Template:Uid\n 14.52%    7.511      1 Template:Main_only\n 10.77%    5.568      1 Template:PageSeo\n 10.68%    5.521      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:27023-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201602 and revision id 344344. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}